  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I can see what groups users I have blocked are in, likewise, this means those that I am blocking can see mine. While I understand my group visibility is public, this is a flaw that should be patched. I don't need cyberstalkers to intentionally join mutual groups to be in the same instance as me. Please address this.",
